<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Gen Physiol</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of General Physiology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0022-1295</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-7748</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2151589</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">200609486092706c</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1085/jgp.200609486092706c</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Qian</surname><given-names>Xiang</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Niu</surname><given-names>Xiaowei</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Magleby</surname><given-names>Karl L.</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>11</month><year>2006</year></pub-date><volume>128</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>629</fpage><lpage>629</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2006, The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement></permissions><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:href="jgp1280629.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Volume 128, No. 4, October 2, 2006. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="128" page="389" id="N0x1ca41c0N0x1db3640" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="17001085" ext-link-type="pubmed">389&#x02013;404</related-article>.</p><p>Due to conversion errors during production, some characters in the paper appear incorrectly. On p. 394, left column, second line, &#x0201c;z5 mV&#x0201d; should be &#x0201c;&#x0223c;5 mV,&#x0201d; and in Fig. 6 (A2, A3, B2, and B3), each &#x0201c;D&#x0201d; should be replaced with a &#x0201c;&#x00394;.&#x0201d; The corrected Fig. 6 appears below.</p><p>The HTML and online PDF for this article have been corrected.</p><p><fig position="anchor" id="fig1"><label>Figure 6.</label><graphic xlink:href="jgp1280629f01"></graphic></fig></p></body></article>